// Snappy feedback (Streets of Rogue): every action answers on the tick it happens with a sound event and a
// small shake. A dig strike on press; a refused dig (granite with only the pickaxe) says so with a clink,
// not silence; a throw is felt; and even a short hop down a ledge lands with a bump.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#.....@.........ddd.#..................#
##########################.............#
##########################.............#
#######################################
end
give Stone 5
mode survival
tool 1 1
// a strike on dirt: heard and felt at once
mine 10-12 11 0
expect 10 ev:Dig == 1
expect 10 shake > 0.05
// granite with only the pickaxe: a clink and a word, at once
mine 40-42 14 0
expect 40 ev:Crack == 1
expect 40 shake > 0.05
// a throw
throw 70 Stone 1 -1 1
expect 70 ev:Click == 1
expect 70 shake > 0.1
// walk off the ledge on the right (0.5 m down): a bump on landing
hold 100-200 right
expect 190 py >= 7.9
expect 190 shake > 0.05            // landed a moment ago: a bump
